This build uses a Perma Tank and a Life Barrier Bonder to tank and kill [[gww:Margonite|Margonites]] in the [[gww:City_of_Torc%27qua|City of Torc'qua]] in normal or hard mode through the use of visage spells and the Anur Tuk's [[gww:Famine|Famine]] spirits.  This can be done with either another player, or using a hero bonder.

== Perma Tank ==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=A/Me Shadow=12+1+3 Illusion=12 Deadly_Arts=3][Deadly Paradox][Shadow Form][Shroud of Distress][Great Dwarf Armor]["I am unstoppable!"][Ancestor's Visage][Sympathetic Visage][Death's Charge][/build]

{{Variantbar|prof=Me|name=Me/A Mesmer Tank|position=1|template=[build prof=Me/A Shadow_Arts=12 Illusion_Magic=8 Fast_Casting=10][Deadly Paradox][Shadow Form][Shroud of Distress][Way of the Master][Way of Perfection]["I Am Unstoppable!"][Ancestor's Visage][Sympathetic Visage][/build]}}

{{Variantbar|prof=E|name=E/Me Elementalist Tank|position=1|template=[build prof=E/Me Earth_Magic=12+1+3 Illusion_Magic=8 Energy_Storage=10 air_magic=2][Glyph of Swiftness][Obsidian Flesh][Stoneflesh Aura][Elemental Lord][Aura of Restoration]["I Am Unstoppable!"][Ancestor's Visage][Sympathetic Visage][/build]}}
