=== Equipment ===
* Full Blessed Armor
* Spear/Sword/Axe of Enchanting with +5 energy
* Shield of Fortitude with +10 Vs Demons - such as the [[gww:Aegis_of_Aaaaarrrrrrggghhh|Aegis of Aaaaarrrrrrggghhh]] or [[gww:Aegis_of_Terror|Aegis of Terror]].
* Enchanting staff of enchanting.  Preferably illusion for wanding down survivors.

=== Usage ===
* Maintain all enchantments (except for the Visage skills) and "I am unstoppable!".
* Group casters and paragons in a tight ball along the wall.
* Drag melee to the ball and start maintaining your visages.  Only have one active at a time otherwise the enemies might break.
* Pick up drops

== {{Mo}}{{R}} Life Barrier Bonder (Hero or Player)==
<pvxbig>
[build prof=Monk/Ranger Protection=12+1+3 Divine=3+3 Beast=12][Balthazar's Spirit][Watchful Spirit][Life Barrier][Life Bond][optional][Blessed Signet][Edge of Extinction][Rebirth][/build]
* If you are bringing a hero, do not bring any other skills that [[gww:Target|Target]].  The hero might walk away from your flag and try to cast it on the tank and grab agro.
* {{skill pvxicon|Optional}}:
** {{skill pvxicon|Vital Blessing|16}}
** {{skill pvxicon|Strength of Honor|8}} (For killing left-overs.)
** {{skill pvxicon|Heal Party|8}}
** {{skill pvxicon|Mindbender|10}} (For quicker placement of bonds.)
</pvxbig>

=== Equipment ===
* Max energy armor
* High energy staff

=== Usage ===
==== Player ====
* Place all of your bonds on the tank and then cast balthazar's spirit on yourself.  Be sure to use Life Barrier before Life Bond. 
* When the tank pings come into spirit range of the mob and lay down Edge of Extinction.  Do not agro anything or attack any spirits.
* Pick up loot.

==== Hero ====
* IMPORTANT: Set hero to [[gww:Hero_behavior#Avoid_Combat|Avoid Combat]]. 
* Cast Balthazar's Spirit on the hero and then cast all bonds on the tank.  Be sure to use Life Barrier before Life Bond.
* When you walk forward and the hero is on the edge of the map, flag the hero inwards along the wall. (See Videos)
* After the group is balled, flag the hero slightly closer so it is in spirit range but not agro range and cast Edge of Extinction. 

== Counters ==
* In Hard mode finding proper placement for the spirit is key due to melee scatter.
* Player or Hero bonder gets agro.
* Tank gets KD while casting Shadow Form.

